            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.25.1+2KI.25.2+2KI.25.3+2KI.25.4+2KI.25.5+2KI.25.6+2KI.25.7+2KI.25.8+2KI.25.9+2KI.25.10+2KI.25.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kerin 25:1-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.17+2CH.36.18+2CH.36.19+2CH.36.20+2CH.36.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kigana 36:17-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wac pa Rwoth obino ri Yeremia, i hongo ma Kere Nebukadineza ma Babilon kanyacel gi jolweny pere je kodi kerin ma piny je kodi nonin je m'oyido go dhumo oyido jolwenyo gi Yerusalem kodi tindin mere je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth waco ama, Were pa Isiraili: Kidhi iluwi gi Kere Zedekia ma Yuda aka iwaci rigo ni, Rwoth waco ama: Akidho ketho tindi madwoŋ me i cingi kere ma Babilon, aka go lawaŋo gi mac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In won ikilakwale wok i cinge, t'ilamakin adieri t'ikethin i cingi go. Ilaneno kere ma Babilon gi waŋin, aka ilaluwo gi go awaŋ g'awaŋ, aka ilakidho i Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kucel winji wac pa Rwoth, Awi Zedekia kere ma Yuda! Rwoth waco ama kwoŋin: Ikilatho g'abor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilatho i siem, aka paka owaŋ ri kwarere perin buban, kerin ma jotelo dhum rin, apaka bende ilawaŋo rin t'iywakin k'iwaco ni, “Awi kere mawan!” Kole An atieko luwo, Rwoth waco.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yeremia jatuci wac Were oluwo wac no je ri Zedekia kere ma Yuda i Yerusalem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "munyo jolweny pa kere ma Babilon oyido jolwenyo gi Yerusalem kodi tindin madongo je ma Yuda m'oyido jodoŋ, Lakis kodi Azeka. Me kende a tindin madongo m'otinda m'oyido jodoŋ i Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tiyo gi ŋecin gi twodo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wac pa Rwoth obino ri Yeremia, rumacen munyo kere Zedekia otieko timo cikirok gi ji ma Yerusalem, tuco gonyo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋecin ma Joyuda ma cwo kodi ma mon, ŋey wongoye ŋata womaki Jaisiraili nyawote paka ŋeca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joje jowinjo, jodhum je kodi ji je m'oyido jotimo cikirok nike jowogony ŋecin pajo, cwo kodi mon, ŋey wongoye ŋata kendo laketho jo i twec, jogonyo jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To rumacen jowire aka jotero ŋecin ma cwo kodi ma mon m'oyido jotieko gonyo to doko jodwoko jo i twec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wac pa Rwoth obino ri Yeremia: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth, Were pa Isiraili waco ama: An won atimo cikirok gi kwarere mewin munyo awodho jo wok i piny Misir, wok i piny ma twec, k'awaco ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.21.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 21:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 15:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kisi oro mar'abirio wiripo gonyo Jaebulaniya moro je m'otana riwin kareno jotieko tic ma oro aucel. Wiripo ywomo jo tic.” To kwarere pajo jok'owinjo kosa jok'ociko ithi gin ran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Win bende manyen me, wipusere to witimo gim'otire ruwaŋan gi tuco gonyo wadi win, aka witimo cikirok i ot m'ilwoŋo gi nyingan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To wiwire kendo to wikoco nyingan munyo kisi dhano odwoko ŋecin ma cwo kodi ma mon m'oyido witieko gonyo cungo kwoŋ mito pajo, aka kendo wiloko jo ŋecin mewin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno Rwoth waco ama: Wikiwinjan nyalo gonyo joger kodi merin mewin. Akidho gonyo win, Rwoth waco, ri abor, two nundu kodi kec. Alamiyo win bedo gi bwok ri kerin je ma i piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jono ma joturo cikirok paran ma jok'okuro yerok ma cikirok ma jotimo ruwaŋan. Alaloko jome paka nyathi dhiaŋ m'otoŋ i diere dirio t'iluwo i diere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jotel ma Yuda, jotel ma Yerusalem, cwo ma jolur, jocway ri Were i wi migam kodi ji je ma piny ma joluwo i dier nyathi dhiaŋ m'oyaŋ diere dirio, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alaketho jo i cingi jokwor pajo kodi jono ma jodwaro kwo pajo. Delkwoŋ jolalokere cemo ri winyin ma koyo kodi ogwaŋe madudi ma piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka ri Zedekia kere ma Yuda kodi jotel pere, alaketho i cingi jokwor pajo kodi jono ma jodwaro kwo pajo, ri jolweny pa kere ma Babilon, ma joweyo monjo win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alawodho or, Rwoth waco, aka aladwoko jo i tindi madwoŋ me, jolalweny gine, jolamako to jowaŋo gi mac. Alaloko tindin ma Yuda m'ojwangere m'ongoye dhano ma bed'iye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
